    </Text>

    <!-- Chemicals Recipes -->
    <!-- Alkaline -->
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143505723</GUID>
      <Text>Alkaline</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143505695</GUID>
      <Text>Obtained by treating soda ash with water and coal, the alkaline reaction produces an essential mineral base. Crucial for saponification, bleaching, and neutralization, this versatile solution stands as one of the quiet pillars of modern chemistry.</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143505694</GUID>
      <Text>Chemical Plant: Alkaline Process</Text>
    </Text>
    <!-- Acidic -->
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143506107</GUID>
      <Text>Acidic</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143505697</GUID>
      <Text>By combining sulfuric acid with soda and iron, this formula unleashes the full corrosive power of minerals. A dangerously reactive mixture capable of stripping the toughest metals, processing heavy ores, or attacking matter where other methods fail.</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143506111</GUID>
      <Text>Chemical Plant: Acidic Process</Text>
    </Text>
    <!-- Solvant -->
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143505881</GUID>
      <Text>Solvant</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143506123</GUID>
      <Text>Born from the thorough distillation of ethanol combined with sulfuric acid, this volatile solvent is the key to fine chemistry. Ideal for dissolving, purifying, or binding complex organic compounds, it refines crude reactants into ready-to-use noble materials.</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143505883</GUID>
      <Text>Chemical Plant: Solvant Synthesis</Text>
    </Text>
    <!-- Petrochemicals -->
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143505882</GUID>
      <Text>Petrochemical</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143506124</GUID>
      <Text>By subjecting crude oil to the fire of sulfuric acid and soda, this synthesis extracts fossil energy in its purest form. A modern refining process supplying the heavy binders and carbon derivatives required by large-scale industry.</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143505884</GUID>
      <Text>Chemical Plant: Petrochemical Refining</Text>
    </Text>

